  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 24/08/2026 the existing use of 11 Inverness Road TW3 3LS as a House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) for up to six people (C4 use) was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nThe evidence provided is sufficient to prove that, on the balance of probability, the use of 11 Inverness Road TW3 3LS as a House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) for up to six people (C4 use) began prior to the Article 4 Direction removing permitted development rights for a change of use from dwellinghouse (C3 use) to an HMO (C4 use) coming into effect on 4th September 2023.\r\n"
  ],
